    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 166,
        "text": "Thanks for coming, everyone. I know the weather is bad, so let's start. This is a planning meeting for our coastal community. We need to talk about uncertainty.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b7c3a77146cb90b8bed7a56e44b23c4c9eb8cdaa1d9ad8b18b6b3bf61561844e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 172,
        "sourceEnd": 204,
        "text": "What do you mean by uncertainty?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "83e28241e30809e7be6a58fc36e948785b57ec4603ec4168b0cfda1217cd3117",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 211,
        "sourceEnd": 409,
        "text": "I mean things we cannot control, like storms, rising sea levels, and changes in fishing rules. If a big storm comes, the harbor may flood. If the harbor floods, the fish market will close for weeks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c4187d15d17dfee46670f03d197e067bb86e4870efd1ed86fd0bf064c917276f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 415,
        "sourceEnd": 454,
        "text": "That sounds serious. So what can we do?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "2a2a689dc5c0aa0103a41367c348f26e29fb5887b4aee660140c709d69c068a3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 461,
        "sourceEnd": 620,
        "text": "First, we can build a higher wall near the harbor. Second, we can move the fish market to higher ground. Third, we can create a community fund for emergencies.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "9288dd35a6358161d089c6733c4c846f5d2e1a294f9d2834f2f90ea456629ca3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "linda",
        "speaker": "Linda",
        "sourceStart": 628,
        "sourceEnd": 674,
        "text": "I like the fund idea. But who will pay for it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "21b90f27dddce073be42c09a1a0a8e9d57a0cc79a3a86a353911c59535d14a4f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 681,
        "sourceEnd": 836,
        "text": "If every family gives a small amount each month, we will have enough money for basic repairs. Also, if the town council agrees, they might match our funds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e469821a44317974ee1d693571fa571af5bc93ad788e1e64793b4b7c690b3ea2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 842,
        "sourceEnd": 900,
        "text": "I'm not sure about moving the market. It's very expensive.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "e15270bff86d5589502512a8d67144440f4c49661067207ef41e1dd1211554a4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 907,
        "sourceEnd": 1039,
        "text": "You're right. It is expensive. But if we don't move it, we might lose it completely in a bad storm. We should consider both options.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7f1f297fcad4d254dd4f87b637ce3eee222581e07cf4ece785099933971f774f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "linda",
        "speaker": "Linda",
        "sourceStart": 1047,
        "sourceEnd": 1100,
        "text": "What about the fishing rules? They change every year.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1d937ede7b06d4befc97f6c6498c819e8f1c87e3b98980c73ddfa3c2a4d79dd3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1107,
        "sourceEnd": 1257,
        "text": "Yes. If the rules change again, some fishermen may lose income. We can ask the council for a support program. If they say no, we can write a petition.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "8093acb3c5a9b3e0f5db4aba3ef8b4553e3761f74d01164600f312312d4f9bd8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1263,
        "sourceEnd": 1293,
        "text": "Okay. So what's the next step?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "440de7a2a08769ad92100edd87a685de0f653f97193f0060276975dc6629303d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1300,
        "sourceEnd": 1444,
        "text": "Let's form a small group. We can meet next week and write a simple plan. If we finish the plan by Friday, we can present it at the town meeting.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "9d3258e2a3b918fbc70af5ab9368de3bdb8d0cabb4988159909fd256faf7441c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "linda",
        "speaker": "Linda",
        "sourceStart": 1452,
        "sourceEnd": 1481,
        "text": "I can help with the petition.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "975fadcc70fda54d5ee6dea015630463e27adf931bd9b27050336eeec7ce24f4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1487,
        "sourceEnd": 1515,
        "text": "I can talk to the fishermen.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "7e84e7a9a9b661b98d3a47760a7245055ac4f993ec2c7a497e38954b396cf735",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1522,
        "sourceEnd": 1710,
        "text": "Great. So, to summarize: we will explore three ideas—the wall, moving the market, and the fund. We will also ask for a support program. And we will meet next Wednesday at seven. Thank you.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "5c2e9d7607078cf6874659ea2d7c522ea3ad6505e6c9a43d91f2112d79e1c3c7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
